cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "CABA Espacios Verdes: Access to Public Green Space in Buenos Aires"
abstract: >-
  Pipeline for access to public green space in Ciudad Autónoma de Buenos Aires.
  It downloads parks and plazas from OpenStreetMap, buffers each one by 500 m,
  weights the gap by the INDEC 2022 census, estimates accessible square metres
  per resident with a two-step floating catchment area, and repeats that metric
  on vegetated area from a Sentinel-2 NDVI composite.
